  "details": "Why can we not just sort alphabetically like we have in game. The order currently does not make complete sense as when looking for someone you will not know how long they have been online so its harder to find someone if you can't spell their username or only know part of their name.\n\nIt can be useful of course to see someone pop up in the top of the list as they instantly come online but that could be a notification style in the other sorting methods if needed.\n\nSome sorting options that come to mind might be,\n- alphabetical (both ascending and descending choices)\n- world ID\n- world instance number (would group friends in the same instance for example)\n- current world users (both ascending and descending choices)",
